  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) skinless, boneless chicken breast half",
    "1 (14.25 ounce) can refried beans",
    "8 ounces corn tortilla chips",
    "1.5 cups grated pepper Jack cheese",
    "0.25 cup chopped green onions",
    "0.5 cup sour cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x9-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d2RWi1NyzzK3_X3_BrIghGb2cEY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-01-2a68fe765d074dd59f8eb9480f62b9b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/143048/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken on a microwave-safe plate; cover with a paper towel. Cook on high power until cooked through and no longer pink, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YEhe6SBwEgZAxKEvcVz0dgqwQk0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-02-b4ffaaa9eda34773828b6e452474f4c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/143048/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool, then shred using a knife; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m2kSzJ2d3vH-2jtavV03-lJUCQY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-03-9d7897ceb81444fa9de3b712197c47d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/143048/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir refried beans in a saucepan over medium until thoroughly heated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ww-5vML2aRcNNTyyb_7amXhqvQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-04-3f2e32a994c5427fac69b66c67318a1d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/143048/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer ½ the chips, ½ cup cheese, and green onions on bottom of the prepared baking dish. Spoon beans over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3Xq1iRfmuTHmxSeapcahzpVIaXU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-05-4a330bd05ad54351b91edae06affff32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/143048/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer ½ cup cheese and sour cream over beans. Arrange shredded chicken over top, then top with remaining ½ chips and ½ cup cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IDaC_1n4MH19LB1rUgbpDMG-htc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-06-2-5b4fb449ce88488bacb4b790dfe615ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/143048/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cheese melts throughout, 15 to 18 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JQko-80xSL73c0v412OS7_sLUAA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-143048-stevens-baked-nachos-VAT-step-07-1cf43abe318e4211ad2550c4312f4b78.jpg"
